<title>UK: Algeria's Skikda port remains shut due to weather.</title>
<headline>Algeria's Skikda port remains shut due to weather.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's Skikda port remained shut on Wednesday after closing on Tuesday because of bad weather, a port official said.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8185</p>
</text>
